@startuml Sequence - Appointment Scheduling
title Appointment Scheduling Flow (API Documentation)

actor Admin
participant "API Gateway\n(Ingress)" as gateway
participant "Appointments-Service" as appointments
participant "Clients-Service" as clients
participant "Doctors-Service" as doctors
database "Appointments DB\n(H2)" as appt_db

Admin -> gateway: POST /appointments/admin\n{patientId, physicianId, dateTime, reason}
gateway -> appointments: Forward to /appointments/admin
appointments -> clients: GET /patients/{patientId}\n(Header: X-INTERNAL-KEY)
clients --> appointments: Patient data (birthDate, etc.)
appointments -> doctors: GET /physicians/{physicianId}\n(Header: X-INTERNAL-KEY)
doctors --> appointments: Physician data
appointments -> appointments: Validate conflicts & save
appointments -> appt_db: Save Appointment
appointments --> gateway: Appointment created
gateway --> Admin: Success

note right: API: /appointments/admin (POST) - Schedules appointment.\nValidates via clients/doctors services.
@enduml
